  "bodyHash": "a43f9503945fca6c",
  "content": "\n\n你好世界\n\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn0.iconfinder.com/data/icons/video-game-items-concepts/128/anvil-512.png\" alt=\"鐵砧、鐵匠、鍛造、冶煉、鑄造、金屬工匠、工藝圖標 - 在 Iconfinder 下載\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" />&nbsp;同時支援 Forge 與 Fabric&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MMHzdZd.png\" alt=\"捲軸圖示 | 免費 SVG\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" /><span style=\"font-size: 1.2rem;\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/371033/description_0c05571f-7c8b-4d39-9bc1-433e1c637e2e.png\" alt=\"腐爛生物 - 標題\" width=\"1280\" height=\"537\" /></h6>\n\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wGw5N7peR7\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/3670/3670325.png\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" /></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/FusionStudioMC\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2168/2168336.png\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" /></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FusionStudioMC\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8DxXLbO.png\" alt=\"Patreon 免費圖示\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" /></a></h6>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 'andale mono', monospace;\"><strong>《腐爛生物》是由 RPorotos 創作、Fusion Studio 開發的模組，致力於加入許多個性鮮明的新型殭屍生物！</strong></span></p>\n\n### <p align=\"center\"> 需要 Platform API </p>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  \n  <a href=\"\">[![Static Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/Requires_Platform-white?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=1b74b6&color=208fc6)](https://modrinth.com/mod/platform)</a>\n  \n</div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>生物資訊：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8f6y-7187d8c6-2d6f-45f7-b454-c72ea5e02981.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..J4mg1irDCH4xCwIhWS0T6hw6bRFthUCaWbn2c9UsyYA\" alt=\"寒冰標幟\" width=\"387\" height=\"86\" /></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8gbk-5eb755bf-ac0e-42fa-97a1-75234adb0408.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..0r6xMalQL_jvRynjOsgg6YeJbFulr0nbKO28o9lmKVw\" alt=\"寒冰圖片\" width=\"1119\" height=\"574\" /></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 當殭屍在粉雪中死亡時，可能會轉化為「凍傷者」，觸發機率取決於難度<br />- 目前生成於寒冷生物群系<br />- 攻擊時會對目標施加凍結效果，持續時間取決於難度<br />- 行走於水面時會將其結冰，類似冰霜行者附魔<br />- 幼體死亡時會引發雪球爆炸，並對附近所有實體施加凍結效果<br />- 看到「焚燼者」會立即攻擊</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 掉落：冰凍腐肉<br /><strong>冰凍腐肉</strong><br />- 由凍傷者掉落<br />- 可烹飪成普通腐肉<br />- 食用時有 80% 機率對食用者施加凍結效果<br />- 可用來釀造凍結藥水<br /><strong>凍結效果</strong><br />- 施加於實體時，會產生強化的緩速效果，甚至可能使目標癱瘓<br />- 被凍結的實體將無法跳躍<br />- 被凍結的實體還會顫抖，並獲得凍結之心與凍結畫面效果<br />- 可製成藥水與塗裝箭矢<br /></span></p>\n</div>\n<h6><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8ff2-6f6e03bf-5455-4b95-a2ac-8da0c0918434.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..gdKL4UjZzxOYsVexqLkQuN3nVKz3FaHsVYwHFTI1oM0\" alt=\"不死礦工標幟\" width=\"387\" height=\"86\" /></h6>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span lang=\"zh-TW\"><strong><img style=\"float: left;\" src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8ggp-ca5c8a4d-c556-45fd-b8c4-e315903cac16.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..lEL96feEaOjuNbvGAnAWj5qsZpzN_9I7Rmncv3vit8Y\" alt=\"不死礦工圖片\" width=\"1119\" height=\"574\" /></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">不死礦工共有 4 種變體：<strong>C 級</strong>（石镐）、<strong>B 級</strong>（鐵镐）、<strong>A 級</strong>（鑽石镐）以及 <strong>M 級</strong>（金镐）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;- 將在主世界任何生物群系的地下及海平面以下生成<br />- 類似殭屍，它們會畏懼陽光<br />- 此生物沒有、未來也不會有幼體變體，你這個怪物。<br />- 擁有四種不同等級：石頭、鐵、鑽石與黃金<br /> + 石頭級最為常見<br /> + 鐵級較為罕見<br /> + 鑽石級最為稀有<br /> + 黃金級會取代荒漠生物群系中的石頭級變體<br />- 各變體可透過其使用的镐子進行辨識，且擁有獨特的掉落物</span></p>\n</div>\n<h6><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8fkl-13b4dcfd-31dd-4c4c-8c7f-0cb7b6f10bf5.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..O73viJ35p3b58U6acefh2nv3Wj2-BmaFbudRNFx1QF4\" alt=\"沼澤殭屍標幟\" width=\"387\" height=\"86\" /></h6>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8gr3-5c78c455-4b31-4641-b42a-b6c2b79933cd.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..h6Fd96osLbm0_qfYCmBL09ekHsYZUFPIUhKwIQ3gDpE\" alt=\"沼澤殭屍圖片\" width=\"1119\" height=\"591\" /><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 目前生成於沼澤生物群系<br />- 攻擊時會向目標躍起<br />- 攻擊時行為有所不同：<br /> + 若為成年體，會施加失明與中毒效果，持續時間取決於難度<br /> + 若為幼體，會引發爆炸並生成滯留型毒霧<br />- 在水中時會獲得移動速度加成<br />- 死亡時有 50% 機率生成滯留型毒霧</span></p>\n</div>\n<h6><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8fo4-5603a88d-fff3-47d0-9bf9-0859eaa1317d.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..egfPQR6k0xLIONHjVrEGAytB2UkQLcTattX865MF6J4\" alt=\"焚燼者標幟\" width=\"387\" height=\"86\" /></h6>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8h97-f02dd540-b0b1-4d53-9889-92d0707cd8f9.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..2jcz7FRADzW0IA-mNeHE1ty65Tb37OL2vC3E56OrUME\" alt=\"焚燼者圖片\" width=\"1119\" height=\"574\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 當殭屍在熔岩中死亡時，可能會轉化為「焚燼者」，觸發機率取決於難度<br />- 目前僅生成於地獄廢墟<br />- 擁有三種不同變體：普通、狂暴與黑曜石<br />- 攻擊時會點燃目標，燃燒持續時間取決於難度<br />- 看到「凍傷者」會立即攻擊</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 掉落：岩漿腐肉<br /><strong>狂暴焚燼者</strong><br /> + 生命值低時會轉化為狂暴變體<br /> + 處於此狀態時會噴發熔岩粒子，狂暴黑曜石變體會噴發黑曜石淚滴粒子<br /> + 狂暴狀態下，攻擊傷害、擊退抗性與移動速度都會提升<br /> + 狂暴變體有 0.5% 的自然生成機率<br /><strong>黑曜石焚燼者</strong><br /> + 接觸水時會轉化為黑曜石變體（雨水與濺射藥水除外）<br /> + 接觸熔岩時會重新點燃<br /> + 黑曜石狀態下，免疫投射物並獲得摔落傷害抗性<br /> + 黑曜石狀態下，攻擊傷害與擊退抗性提升，但移動速度會變慢</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>岩漿腐肉</strong><br />- 由焚燼者掉落<br />- 可作為熔爐燃料使用，但需消耗三單位才能燒製單一物品<br />- 食用時有 50% 機率賦予食用者防火效果，但也有 50% 機率將實體點燃</span></p>\n</div>\n<h6><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/873297891165339673/1031324650581540904/Glacial_Hunter1.png\" alt=\"腐爛愛斯基摩人標幟\" width=\"387\" height=\"86\" /></h6>\n<h6>&nbsp;</h6>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8ivk-8d4783ce-4dcc-4be0-860a-6bb1f6ad1165.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..DiB9bSWaF9uvbbLGH0G_20ctyVgwT8IAp8yoLKi6lyg\" alt=\"腐爛愛斯基摩人圖片\" width=\"1119\" height=\"578\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>掉落：</strong>1-2 個腐肉、1 張皮革、1-2 條生鱈魚或 1 條熟鱈魚。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>生成：</strong>在<strong>雪地生物群系</strong>中有稀有機率生成。他的<strong><b>狼</b></strong>&nbsp;有 50% 機率伴隨生成。持有<strong>長矛</strong>的變體出現機率為 40%。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>額外資訊：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 擊中玩家時會施加<b><strong>緩速&nbsp;<strong>II</strong>&nbsp;</b>。<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">（效果持續時間取決於難度）</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"zh-TW\">- </span><span lang=\"zh-TW\">若你擊打它，他有機率掉落生鱈魚。每次攻擊都算數，即使是用其他物品。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"zh-TW\">-&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"zh-TW\"><strong>持矛的冰川獵手</strong>&nbsp;擁有更遠的攻擊範圍並施加擊退效果。不過，他不會施加緩速效果。</span></span></p>\n</div>\n<h6><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8fw3-b8694938-ab6b-4750-8e97-8e3d2fafd6b9.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..PzWmv2NeFCFNRy1KKbclXERoyTM32Tk164Er8br2AWo\" alt=\"木乃伊標幟\" width=\"387\" height=\"86\" /></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8hgg-38554ef4-d80f-442b-8a5d-bdb092ba6714.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..76J1DjA9ynA2wC7xLfDH00rN5IxopJG176lVUWhhY1c\" alt=\"木乃伊圖片\" width=\"1119\" height=\"578\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>掉落：</strong>1-2 個腐肉、1-2 張紙、2-4 個金粒或 1 個金錠。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>生成：</strong>在<strong>沙漠生物群系</strong>中有稀有機率生成。他的變體（古代木乃伊）出現機率為 35%。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>額外資訊：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 木乃伊擊中玩家時會施加<strong>飢餓 III&nbsp;</strong>。<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">（效果持續時間取決於難度）<strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-TW\">- </span></strong><span lang=\"zh-TW\">追蹤實體時，他有稀有機率生成一隻<strong>甲蟲</strong>。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;此生物死亡時，會生成 2 至 3 隻甲蟲。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 古代木乃伊可召喚<strong>飛天甲蟲</strong>而非普通甲蟲。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>未來計畫：</strong>僅在沙漠神殿中生成。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8fzn-4aecaa99-df27-460c-bd40-de35de0d9391.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..Q9dQBAUeNsuBeRWafQaFFRySTsIIPEKdAN16aszduOk\" alt=\"死鬍男標幟\" width=\"387\" height=\"86\" /></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8hq7-27b7fa60-46a0-460d-a7ac-4ec505930ee3.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.._0ybvL3j8Y1zxiT3KngtKKAW4kKHbdWvh7YqI_SbIgM\" alt=\"死鬍男圖片\" width=\"1119\" height=\"574\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>掉落：</strong>與沉船寶箱相同的掉落表，外加 1-2 個腐肉和&nbsp;1<strong>&nbsp;寶箱。</strong>若他帶著<strong>TNT 桶</strong>死亡，則可能掉落該方塊。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>生成：</strong>海灘生物群系。（極度稀有）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>額外資訊：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 他擁有<strong>擊退抗性。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 當這隻殭屍移動時，他有機率生成<strong>殭屍海盜</strong>或<strong>骷髏海盜</strong>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-TW\">-</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-TW\">當死鬍男生命值過低時，</span><span lang=\"zh-TW\">他會取出</span><strong><span lang=\"zh-TW\"> TNT 桶 </span></strong><span lang=\"zh-TW\">並在 5 秒後爆炸。<strong>若他爆炸，則不會掉落任何物品。</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;<strong>殭屍海盜</strong>與<strong>骷髏海盜</strong>&nbsp;會在 30 秒後消失。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>未來計畫：</strong>僅在沉船或自訂船隻中生成。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h6><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8g6n-60911f4a-3f32-4aa6-a1fb-0a42ece7d645.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..d8jWh8k0N4VHU30PlFAiR3QJ-rzYfYZ6qUjFdZNw3G4\" alt=\"不朽者標幟\" width=\"387\" height=\"90\" /></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span lang=\"zh-TW\"><strong><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddt8ob3-97aea6ea-1131-457e-9368-e9934618b455.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..5ke_ShKJskDbcnLQG7vyMV1PfEkERrGJ24Ib0fC3sMw\" alt=\"不朽者圖片\" width=\"1119\" height=\"592\" /></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>掉落：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">常規掉落：</span></span> <span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">1-2 個</span> <span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">腐肉、1-2 根骨頭。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">雷雨天氣時：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">100% 機率掉落一把<strong>三叉戟</strong>，附魔為：引雷 I、激流 I 或無附魔。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">非雷雨天氣時：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">10% 機率掉落一把普通三叉戟。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>生成：</strong>雷雨期間主世界全域生成。<strong>&nbsp;</strong>（極度稀有）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">以下生物群系除外：</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 60px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 沙漠。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 60px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 惡地</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 60px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 雪地。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>額外資訊：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 擊中玩家時會施加<strong>引雷效果&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">-<strong>&nbsp;</strong>被雷擊中時，生命值會恢復。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 他可以感染/轉化殭屍。（殭屍會轉化為「閃電殭屍」Zap，即不朽者的新實體後代）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"zh-TW\">-</span><span lang=\"zh-TW\">當他生命值過低時，<b>身旁會出現不同類型的閃電，且他的速度會提升。</b></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"zh-TW\"><b>- 不朽者被擊中時會隨機移動。</b></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\">-&nbsp;他能執行「衝鋒攻擊」。攻擊結束後，他的生命值會恢復。</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\">- <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">若雷雨天氣結束，不朽者將失去所有「能力」&nbsp;<u>且身上會出現紅色粒子...</u></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>物品/方塊資訊：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddy1mkq-8be75ed4-5601-45bd-a03b-f5157cc95909.png/v1/fill/w_1280,h_224,strp/rotten_creatures___frf_banner_by_raiporotos_ddy1mkq-fullview.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ1cm46YXBwOiIsImlzcyI6InVybjphcHA6Iiwib2JqIjpbW3siaGVpZ2h0IjoiPD0yMjQiLCJwYXRoIjoiXC9mXC82NzZjMzhjNy00NWNiLTQwZjktODczNS1kYzFkODQ4OTEwNmNcL2RkeTFta3EtOGJlNzVlZDQtNTYwMS00NWJkLWEwM2ItZjUxNTdjYzk1OTA5LnBuZyIsIndpZHRoIjoiPD0xMjgwIn1dXSwiYXVkIjpbInVybjpzZXJ2aWNlOmltYWdlLm9wZXJhdGlvbnMiXX0.QvFX4eLub0pl8qL0FQs_T0F0i_VU0_L45nS-lKFsvo4\" alt=\"冰凍腐肉標幟\" width=\"389\" height=\"68\" /></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">來自凍傷者的冰涼腐肉。</span><strong><br /></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"color: #000000;\">若你食用它：</span></strong></span></p>\n- 有 80% 機率施加 15 秒的凍結效果 <br />- 可烹飪成腐肉<br />\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>額外資訊：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;你可以烹飪冰凍腐肉以獲得普通腐肉。（可使用熔爐、煙燻爐或營火）。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/293/990/frf-usos.png\" alt=\"熔爐中的冰凍腐肉\" width=\"298\" height=\"203\" /></p>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddy1mkz-2e33a9cf-1e37-42c1-8345-6cbc3cecc6a8.png/v1/fill/w_1280,h_224,strp/rotten_creatures___irf_banner_by_raiporotos_ddy1mkz-fullview.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ1cm46YXBwOiIsImlzcyI6InVybjphcHA6Iiwib2JqIjpbW3siaGVpZ2h0IjoiPD0yMjQiLCJwYXRoIjoiXC9mXC82NzZjMzhjNy00NWNiLTQwZjktODczNS1kYzFkODQ4OTEwNmNcL2RkeTFta3otMmUzM2E5Y2YtMWUzNy00MmMxLTgzNDUtNmNiYzNjZWNjNmE4LnBuZyIsIndpZHRoIjoiPD0xMjgwIn1dXSwiYXVkIjpbInVybjpzZXJ2aWNlOmltYWdlLm9wZXJhdGlvbnMiXX0.8r8l7dTiwkTDRXEwitzCcfqElVruLvi1A2MwpLY8deg\" alt=\"岩漿腐肉標幟\" width=\"383\" height=\"67\" /></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span lang=\"zh-TW\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">來自焚燼者的熾熱腐肉。</span><strong><br /></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-TW\">若你食用它：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span lang=\"zh-TW\">- 有 50% 機率賦予 15 秒的防火效果，或將使用者點燃 5 秒 <br />- 可作為熔爐燃料使用，但燒製單一物品需至少消耗 3 單位</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/293/991/irf-usos.png\" /></p>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddy1mu7-fcba87d0-acb4-4167-b286-6cd4b455d6cb.png/v1/fill/w_1280,h_242,strp/rotten_creatures___tnt_barrel_banner_by_raiporotos_ddy1mu7-fullview.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ1cm46YXBwOiIsImlzcyI6InVybjphcHA6Iiwib2JqIjpbW3siaGVpZ2h0IjoiPD0yNDIiLCJwYXRoIjoiXC9mXC82NzZjMzhjNy00NWNiLTQwZjktODczNS1kYzFkODQ4OTEwNmNcL2RkeTFtdTctZmNiYTg3ZDAtYWNiNC00MTY3LWIyODYtNmNkNGI0NTVkNmNiLnBuZyIsIndpZHRoIjoiPD0xMjgwIn1dXSwiYXVkIjpbInVybjpzZXJ2aWNlOmltYWdlLm9wZXJhdGlvbnMiXX0.ZnSv0gwSLP8nmvl1g6uw5kZPu2vGcWRYh4_mVTcAaZk\" alt=\"TNT 桶標幟\" width=\"386\" height=\"73\" /></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">死鬍男的最強武器。</span></p>\n<p><strong>資訊：</strong></p>\n<p><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;它的爆炸半徑與 TNT 相同。</p>\n<p>- 若想像普通 TNT 一樣激活 TNT 桶，可使用打火石或火焰彈。</p>\n<p>- 若對其使用紅石機制，TNT 桶會<strong>立即爆炸。</strong>&nbsp;（若爆炸波及該方塊也會觸發此特性）。</p>\n<p>- <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">你可使用火箭點燃它，使其朝你視線的各個方向發射。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/676c38c7-45cb-40f9-8735-dc1d8489106c/ddy1mxa-afe22255-ff5c-4264-8abc-3b9fc1a07ba4.png/v1/fill/w_1280,h_242,strp/rotten_creatures___treasure_chest_banner_by_raiporotos_ddy1mxa-fullview.png?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ1cm46YXBwOiIsImlzcyI6InVybjphcHA6Iiwib2JqIjpbW3siaGVpZ2h0IjoiPD0yNDIiLCJwYXRoIjoiXC9mXC82NzZjMzhjNy00NWNiLTQwZjktODczNS1kYzFkODQ4OTEwNmNcL2RkeTFteGEtYWZlMjIyNTUtZmY1Yy00MjY0LThhYmMtM2I5ZmMxYTA3YmE0LnBuZyIsIndpZHRoIjoiPD0xMjgwIn1dXSwiYXVkIjpbInVybjpzZXJ2aWNlOmltYWdlLm9wZXJhdGlvbnMiXX0.q532H8uIeKk6n2QhUCWchCx7e68Nv3m21wkTil--yMA\" alt=\"寶箱標幟\" width=\"386\" height=\"73\" /></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">海盜們珍視的寶箱</span></p>\n<p><strong>資訊：</strong></p>\n<p><strong>-</strong>&nbsp;殺死死鬍男即可獲取。</p>\n<p>- 要開啟寶箱，必須先將其放置在地面上。</p>\n<p>- 寶箱開啟後，可能隨機掉落物品，例如：鐵粒、金粒、金錠、綠寶石、鑽石或不死图腾。</p>\n<p>- 寶箱掉落所有戰利品後會消失。</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6><span lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000;\"><strong>開發中/測試物品：</strong></span></h6>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h6 style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">喪屍化藥水：</span>&nbsp;</strong>賦予使用者殭屍特性的藥水。</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"padding-left: 60px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">特性：</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"padding-left: 90px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 喪屍化期間的效果：<strong>飢餓 V</strong>、<strong>緩速 II</strong> 與 <strong>力量</strong>。</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"padding-left: 90px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- 若飢餓值過低，力量效果會增強<span lang=\"zh-TW\">最高至 III 級（飢餓值空時）。</span></span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"padding-left: 90px;\"><span lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">- <strong>中毒</strong>會賦予使用者瞬間生命。比普通的瞬間生命或再生藥水更有用。</span></h6>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span lang=\"zh-TW\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">若要取消效果，必須在主手放置金蘋果，牛奶無效。</span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<h6 class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"Traducci&oacute;n\"><span style=\"color: #99cc00;\">&nbsp;</span></h6>\n<h6 class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-placeholder=\"Traducci&oacute;n\"><span style=\"color: #99cc00;\">__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</span></h6>\n<h6 class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"Traducci&oacute;n\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>🎬 模組評測：</strong></span></h6>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;英文評測 by&nbsp;<a title=\"textConjure Channel\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCLFwpjTgsxN1VWnc52HxHHg/featured\">textConjure</a>。模組版本：<strong>1.14.4</strong>&nbsp;<strong>v0.9.5</strong><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Y3xIjG-g3H0\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>西班牙文評測 by <a title=\"Youtube Channel\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmJHe4_lfVC5yPIhiiCiQaQ\">Dan Space</a>。模組版本：<strong>1.14.4</strong>&nbsp;<strong>v0.9.2</strong></p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/J-3zzk39p2s\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>俄文評測 by <a class=\"yt-simple-endpoint style-scope yt-formatted-string\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\" spellcheck=\"false\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0IAjf7iwTI2Iyk8jSXArjg\">Канал Кейна</a>。模組版本：<strong>1.15.2</strong>&nbsp;<strong>v0.9.7</strong></p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ftjmeN5WehQ\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></p>\n</div>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #99cc00;\">__________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</span></h6>\n<p class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-placeholder=\"Traducci&oacute;n\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Fusion Studio 的模組開發資金皆由團隊自行籌措，因此雖然我們未來仍計劃加入更多內容，但目前暫無精力進行向下移植。若您希望支持本模組及其他模組的持續開發，並協助籌備 1.16 版本的移植工作，歡迎考慮前往我們的 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/FusionStudioMC\">Patreon！</a>進行贊助</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
